Subject: [PATCH 06/42] feat(dashboard): add SLA risk orders list to dashboard
 summary (schema + service + table)

Spec-014 Sprint 2. Adds DashboardSlaRiskOrderSchema and slaRiskOrders to
DashboardSummarySchema (contract migration 061, non-breaking, default []).
New dashboard-sla.service computes active cases overdue or within 72h of their
promised completion date (critical <24h, warning <72h), with a pure mapper unit
tested. Frontend renders SlaRiskOrdersTable with deep-links to each case cockpit.

Includes the previously uncommitted spec-012/013 dashboard extraction
(demand/efficiency/financial/readiness sub-services and DashboardCommandCenter)
as build prerequisites of this vertical.

